31
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Start the operation!
— Start the operation!</font>

32
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:46,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Destruction of</font>

33
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:46,710
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Leaf Village Commenced!</font>

34
00:01:56,970 --> 00:01:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

35
00:01:58,470 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

36
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kazekage-dono!
What is going on?</font>

37
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:09,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

38
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

39
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Squad One, above.</font>

40
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Squad Two, below!
Protect the lords!</font>

41
00:02:29,710 --> 00:02:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in the way!</font>

42
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:51,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama...
Please... flee...</font>

43
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally our time to
come on the scene.</font>

44
00:03:15,090 --> 00:03:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've been transformed
such a long time.</font>

45
00:03:17,340 --> 00:03:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm totally pent up with frustration.</font>

46
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys smell all sweaty!</font>

47
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, we're all comrades, right...?</font>

48
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sound Ninja...!</font>

49
00:03:31,310 --> 00:03:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raido...</font>

50
00:03:32,850 --> 00:03:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're heading out to
back up Hokage-sama.</font>

51
00:03:34,230 --> 00:03:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful of any traps!</font>

52
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it...</font>

53
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

54
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ninja Art!
— Ninja Art!</font>

55
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Four Flames Formation!
— Four Flames Formation!</font>

56
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Barrier...!</font>

57
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kazekage-dono...</font>

58
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Barrier Ninjutsu, huh?!</font>

59
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that they could outwit ANBU...</font>

60
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're not just ordinary...</font>

61
00:04:20,570 --> 00:04:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing here?!
Hokage-sama is in danger!</font>

62
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a nuisance...</font>

63
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that the enemy was
masquerading as our ANBU...</font>

64
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it was also that guy
who used Genjutsu!</font>

65
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... there's no mistake.</font>

66
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect that...</font>

67
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Village would betray Leaf Village.</font>

68
00:04:52,930 --> 00:04:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The treaty is simply a camouflage to
make the enemy let down their guard.</font>

69
00:04:58,150 --> 00:05:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The petty little battle game ends now.</font>

70
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From this point on, the course
of history will change!</font>

71
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying that
you're starting a war?</font>

72
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

73
00:05:13,250 --> 00:05:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One should avoid resolution
through armed force</font>

74
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and should rather seek
a solution through negotiations.</font>

75
00:05:20,130 --> 00:05:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's still time... Kazekage-dono!</font>

76
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:31,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps one gets addicted to
peace as one grows older...</font>

77
00:05:32,810 --> 00:05:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi-sensei!</font>

78
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're...</font>

79
00:05:48,610 --> 00:05:50,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just my bad luck...</font>

80
00:05:50,530 --> 00:05:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to have lookout duty
on a day like this.</font>

81
00:05:52,910 --> 00:05:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to watch Chunin Exam too.</font>

82
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop fussing.</font>

83
00:05:57,580 --> 00:05:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam takes
place twice a year.</font>

84
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll have many more chances
to see it.</font>

85
00:06:02,090 --> 00:06:06,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this year, that kid from
the Uchiha Clan is taking part, right?</font>

86
00:06:06,340 --> 00:06:08,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I won't have
a chance to see that...</font>

87
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be able to die peacefully.</font>

88
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!</font>

89
00:06:29,490 --> 00:06:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's time! Begin!</font>

90
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Summoning has succeeded.</font>

91
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huge boa!</font>

92
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Notify Hokage-sama immediately!</font>

93
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not letting you in the village!</font>

94
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dispatch the reinforcements immediately!</font>

95
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

96
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:36,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Ninja!</font>

97
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

98
00:07:44,110 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that, Gaara!</font>

99
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:49,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kill him...!</font>

100
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:54,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no meaning in
continuing this fight!</font>

101
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:56,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget our mission!</font>

102
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of my way...!</font>

103
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you guys doing?!</font>

104
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:05,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The operation is already underway!</font>

105
00:08:19,930 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is going on?</font>

106
00:08:25,150 --> 00:08:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

107
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?!</font>

108
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:32,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His wound is deeper than
I thought!</font>

109
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover his Chakra
is pretty drained!</font>

110
00:08:36,370 --> 00:08:38,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case,
what about using that thing...?</font>

111
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible to do right away!</font>

112
00:08:40,490 --> 00:08:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! It's all because
you didn't wait for the signal</font>

113
00:08:42,830 --> 00:08:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and tried to become
the Perfect Possession...</font>

114
00:08:45,250 --> 00:08:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?!</font>

115
00:08:47,210 --> 00:08:48,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you saying we have to do
this without Gaara?</font>

116
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:03,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't Gaara here yet?!</font>

117
00:09:09,770 --> 00:09:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara is Sand's trump card.</font>

118
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to get Gaara to do his work,
no matter what!</font>

119
00:09:16,950 --> 00:09:20,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys leave for the moment and
tend to Gaara's wounds!</font>

120
00:09:21,290 --> 00:09:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as Gaara's Chakra has
been restored...</font>

121
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the operation will recommence!</font>

122
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

123
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about you, Sensei?!</font>

124
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna suppress those guys!</font>

125
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think things will
go according to your plan?</font>

126
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make them so...</font>

127
00:09:57,660 --> 00:09:58,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

128
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:00,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

129
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Orochimaru the host of this party?</font>

130
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:17,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dunno... In any case,
let's heat this thing up.</font>

131
00:10:24,470 --> 00:10:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

132
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:30,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but the Chunin Exam ends here.</font>

133
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've already achieved Chunin level.</font>

134
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:39,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a Leaf Shinobi,
be of service to the Leaf!</font>

135
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, I'm supposed to
take down that jerk Gaara, right?</font>

136
00:10:43,410 --> 00:10:44,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A continuation of earlier on, right?</font>

137
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't pursue too far.</font>

138
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on, it's no longer an exam.
It's the real thing!</font>

139
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I have to do though...
is the same!</font>

140
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let him through!</font>

141
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

142
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boy, oh boy...</font>

143
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We intended to take Sasuke-kun
while Gaara was causing the trouble.</font>

144
00:11:20,070 --> 00:11:23,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But not everything goes as planned.</font>

145
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Is that so?</font>

146
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:34,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Leaf Village and...
Sasuke were the target, huh?</font>

147
00:11:35,590 --> 00:11:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the Leaf such a big catch?</font>

148
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
if Gaara wakes up,</font>

149
00:11:43,010 --> 00:11:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be able to show you something
much more interesting.</font>

150
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, anyway...</font>

151
00:11:48,850 --> 00:11:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your thick-headedness has caused
the Leaf to be outmaneuvered.</font>

152
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my win.</font>

153
00:11:56,730 --> 00:11:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing is decided
until the very end.</font>

154
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that's what I taught you...</font>

155
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru.</font>

156
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:22,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought this day would
eventually arrive.</font>

157
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

158
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't get my head that easily!</font>

159
00:12:31,350 --> 00:12:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you, didn't I?</font>

160
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:36,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is preferable to decide
the Fifth Hokage quickly...</font>

161
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:38,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Hokage...</font>

162
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because you will... die here.</font>

163
00:13:00,170 --> 00:13:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder how the Chunin Exams
are going?</font>

164
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Naruto's match is over yet?</font>

165
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first match was
with Neji, right?</font>

166
00:13:12,470 --> 00:13:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want him to win that
match somehow or other.</font>

167
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no good!</font>

168
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A teacher mustn't root for
one particular student!</font>

169
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:20,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All the graduating students
are dear to him!</font>

170
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must root for all of them equally!</font>

171
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:31,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I still... want Naruto to win...</font>

172
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you worried about Naruto nii-chan?</font>

173
00:13:34,250 --> 00:13:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, of course...!</font>

174
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought...</font>

175
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You guys...</font>

176
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:46,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you to do ten laps around
the school grounds, didn't I?!</font>

177
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We finished that long ago.</font>

178
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While you were daydreaming, Sensei.</font>

179
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:57,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When our teacher is in that state,
he can't teach a class!</font>

180
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So let's call it quits for today!</font>

181
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No, no!
I'm continuing with class.</font>

182
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what that smoke is...?</font>

183
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's coming from the direction
of the exam arena...</font>

184
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there some disturbance
to the east?</font>

185
00:14:18,710 --> 00:14:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if something happened?</font>

186
00:14:26,170 --> 00:14:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru...</font>

187
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?</font>

188
00:14:29,130 --> 00:14:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should we send reinforcements?</font>

189
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... It's dangerous to make a move
when we don't really know</font>

190
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what the situation is.</font>

191
00:14:35,810 --> 00:14:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the mastermind is Orochimaru...</font>

192
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even more so.</font>

193
00:14:41,060 --> 00:14:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Orochimaru...
that dangerous a guy?</font>

194
00:14:45,900 --> 00:14:49,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Originally... he was a student
of the Third Hokage.</font>

195
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:52,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So why did he become a Rogue Ninja?</font>

196
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long ago, when the Fourth Hokage
was decided...</font>

197
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru apparently asserted that
he was capable of taking on that role.</font>

198
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But his request was denied.</font>

199
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And shortly afterwards,
that guy slipped out of this village.</font>

200
00:15:11,010 --> 00:15:13,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru most likely holds
a grudge against</font>

201
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Third Hokage because of that.</font>

202
00:15:16,350 --> 00:15:17,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Revenge... is it?</font>

203
00:15:18,230 --> 00:15:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably.</font>

204
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:22,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long ago, when I was a kid...</font>

205
00:15:23,770 --> 00:15:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's one thing I remember
thinking when I saw that guy...</font>

206
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That he didn't seem human...</font>

207
00:15:35,530 --> 00:15:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That he seems to be something
that just took on a human form...</font>

208
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Frightening...</font>

209
00:15:43,710 --> 00:15:46,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Simply... frightening.</font>

210
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:51,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reporting!</font>

211
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:53,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A large boa has appeared near
the eastern gate of the Leaf Village!</font>

212
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And behind it, some one hundred
Sand Shinobi are infiltrating the country!</font>

213
00:15:58,310 --> 00:16:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are currently engaged in
armed conflict with our Shinobi</font>

214
00:16:00,310 --> 00:16:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who were patrolling nearby!</font>

215
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand...?!</font>

216
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave Squad One and Two behind
and make for the eastern gate.</font>

217
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Immediately!</font>

218
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes, sir!
— Yes, sir!</font>

219
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:23,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't let you past this point!</font>

220
00:16:38,850 --> 00:16:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's quite a large number.</font>

221
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were careless!</font>

222
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And even Hokage-sama has been...</font>

223
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi! Look inside the Barrier!</font>

224
00:16:48,770 --> 00:16:49,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

225
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:50,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

226
00:16:57,410 --> 00:16:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru!</font>

227
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:00,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

228
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:03,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is that guy...?</font>

229
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that
they're after Sasuke-kun again?!</font>

230
00:17:09,090 --> 00:17:09,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

231
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

232
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not there...?</font>

233
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, stay there for a while.</font>

234
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna go reduce
the number of enemies.</font>

235
00:18:03,810 --> 00:18:06,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I'm worried about
Hokage-sama, but...</font>

236
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave above to ANBU.</font>

237
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides...</font>

238
00:18:10,690 --> 00:18:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama isn't the kind of guy
who can be taken down that easily.</font>

239
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

240
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, he is the Hokage of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

241
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:36,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you so happy, you're crying?</font>

242
00:18:37,090 --> 00:18:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or...</font>

243
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:45,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">do you have an iota of sadness
in your heart to kill me, your teacher?</font>

244
00:18:47,730 --> 00:18:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

245
00:19:05,410 --> 00:19:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since earlier on, I was feeling so sleepy...</font>

246
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:10,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'm finally awake.</font>

247
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I thought.</font>

248
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you aren't someone
who would hold a grudge.</font>

249
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:27,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have neither a goal nor motive.</font>

250
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... I guess...</font>

251
00:19:30,730 --> 00:19:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do kind of have a goal.</font>

252
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I were to explain it...</font>

253
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's interesting to watch things
that move.</font>

254
00:19:40,950 --> 00:19:44,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get no pleasure if
something doesn't move.</font>

255
00:19:44,950 --> 00:19:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like a windmill that doesn't turn...</font>

256
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it may have some kind
of appeal once in a while.</font>

257
00:19:51,870 --> 00:19:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But usually,
it's not worth looking at it.</font>

258
00:19:55,880 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now... with a wind called
"Destroy the Leaf Village,"</font>

259
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:02,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to turn that windmill.</font>

260
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the same as always...</font>

261
00:20:24,870 --> 00:20:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

262
00:20:27,410 --> 00:20:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was worth teaching you Genjutsu
survival training</font>

263
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">during the Genin Exam.</font>

264
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You truly have a talent for it.</font>

265
00:20:35,790 --> 00:20:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

266
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release the Genjutsu and
wake up Naruto and Shikamaru!</font>

267
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto will be delighted.</font>

268
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll be getting a mission
after such a long while.</font>

269
00:20:52,230 --> 00:20:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by a mission?</font>

270
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful...</font>

271
00:20:57,230 --> 00:21:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first A-ranked mission
since the Land of the Waves.</font>

272
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

273
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

274
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

275
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

276
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

277
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

278
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

279
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

280
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

281
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

282
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

283
00:21:53,380 --> 00:21:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

284
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

285
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:58,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

286
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

287
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

288
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:19,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

289
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:19,540
